d42c683df","title":"Doctor Elise","altTitle":"Queen with a Scalpe","description":"Dalam kehidupan pertama dia adalah seorang ratu yang mengerikan, yang membawa masalah ke negaranya, dan akhirnya, rajanya sendiri membakarnya di tiang pancang. Dalam kehidupan kedua, dia menjadi ahli bedah berbakat, menebus masa lalunya, menyelamatkan orang. Tetapi karena kecelakaan pesawat, ahli bedah berbakat Song Zhi Hyun kembali ke kehidupan sebelumnya! Kali ini, dia memutuskan untuk mengubah segalanya, menjadi seorang dokter.—-Song Ji Hyeon adalah seorang ahli bedah, sekaligus seorang dokter jenius yang diangkat sebagai dosen termuda di Universitas Seoul. Dia membawa kenangan kehidupan sebelumnya sebagai Elise De Clorence yang hidup sebagai wanita jahat. Tiba-tiba kecelakaan tak terduga terjadi dan ketika dia bangun, dia kembali ke kehidupan sebelumnya?! Akankah Elise dapat memperbaiki kesalahan masa lalunya?","year":2017,"status":"completed","lastChapter":"156","contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Isekai","Medical","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/8368162b-a57e-4374-877a-926d42c683df/91214ee4-1cee-452a-bcd9-c4a2695efcd0.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["ru","en","pt-br","es","hu","id"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":8.65,"follows":48867,"listAt":"2026-10-19T10:05:22.881Z","chapters":[{"id":"06173afe-ca38-4f6b-af16-48c6979a5645","number":"122","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":16,"createdAt":"2020-10-23T12:52:29+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"b14067e6-874c-4476-8dac-72a9725f86c4","number":"121","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":13,"createdAt":"2020-10-23T12:47:35+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"a7ecc12f-c98c-474d-92da-872b6bfa362f","number":"120","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":15,"createdAt":"2020-09-01T08:44:27+00:00","baked":true},{"id":"6578ce8a-f822-4db9-b9e6-622bd98edd42","number":"119","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":16,"createdAt":"2020-09-01T08:40:22+00:00","baked":true},{"id